#. Default text stored as data (email template, product or timetable).
msgid "Every class is a ticket"
msgstr "Minden óra egy sorsjegy"

#: data
#. Default text stored as data (email template, product or timetable).
msgid ""
"Hi {first_name},\n"
"\n"
"the {period} draw is done: {prize} went to one of our most dedicated students ({tickets} tickets from {entrants} of you were in the hat).\n"
"\n"
"A new round has started: every class you come to until {next_draw} is one more ticket."
msgstr ""
"Szia {first_name}!\n"
"\n"
"Lezajlott a(z) {period} sorsolás: a(z) {prize} az egyik leghűségesebb vendégünkhöz került ({entrants} résztvevőtől {tickets} sorsjegy volt a kalapban).\n"
"\n"
"Új kör indult: {next_draw}-ig minden óra, amire eljössz, még egy sorsjegy."

